{"ID":"20240522082237-00xv4oi","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082237-00xv4oi","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082237-00xv4oi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082237-8l0mxog\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522101721-u9ltdw7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2800,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522101721-yj22gse\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:435,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:435\u0026#125;","title":"克農氏症","type":"doc","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522082237-8l0mxog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082237-8l0mxog","updated":"20240522101713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"經方的“一劑知”"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-unzokup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-unzokup","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M. B. ，男，67歲"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-4rvidh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-4rvidh7","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初診："}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-939iqvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-939iqvc","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11/30/09，星期一，"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-n0tetsq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-n0tetsq","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一位意大利男子在他的韓國太太陪同下來診。"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-uy015mj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-uy015mj","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我還未開始問診，他先對我進行一番問診，"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-z0x9q9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-z0x9q9z","updated":"20240522101740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“你行醫多久了？”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-2jrsii5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-2jrsii5","updated":"20240522101741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“你的指導老師呢？”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-830zd3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-830zd3d","updated":"20240522101742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“呆會兒誰監督你開的處方？”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-55il5f1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-55il5f1","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"……"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-4eil5o5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-4eil5o5","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很顯然，他對面前的這位黃毛丫頭很沒信心……"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-tv9clee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-tv9clee","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一一回答完他的問題後，輪到我發問了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-y9ltexc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-y9ltexc","updated":"20240522101932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“請問您得Crohn’s Disease多久了？”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-splxgpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-splxgpp","updated":"20240522101751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“20年了。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-qm64pay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-qm64pay","updated":"20240522101934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“請問您什么時候拿掉大腸的？”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-moxjg9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-moxjg9p","updated":"20240522101752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“1年半前。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-u64as1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-u64as1k","updated":"20240522101935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“請問您拿掉大腸後病情有無好轉？”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-l6sk8tq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-l6sk8tq","updated":"20240522101753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“沒有，大便還是一天6次，呈膠狀。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-kl82jwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-kl82jwm","updated":"20240522101935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“請問您知道這個病是怎么得來的嗎？”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-vjonc2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-vjonc2u","updated":"20240522101755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“遺傳。我祖父也有Crohn’s Disease.”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-hi9imho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-hi9imho","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（又來了！動不動就是遺傳。這西醫也挺好當的嘛。發病原因：遺傳；治病方法：切掉；結果不好，對不起，此病目前無藥可醫。）"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-63ailgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-63ailgs","updated":"20240522101940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“請問您的腳是冷的，還是熱的？”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-sfa7hk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-sfa7hk3","updated":"20240522101758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“冷的。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-ytndy60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-ytndy60","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我再一摸他的手，也是冷的。"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-gawl88o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-gawl88o","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"套用師父的話——已經結束了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-r8hya49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-r8hya49","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接下來，開始用倪式圖表解說法向他解釋大腸與小腸的關系，小腸與心臟的關系，手腳的溫度與心臟小腸的關系。"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-fs1vfle","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-fs1vfle","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說的過程中，這位先生插話，"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-jx5dr6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-jx5dr6s","updated":"20240522101802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“對不起，比起手腳的溫度，我更關心我的Crohn’s。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-kmqg2yv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-kmqg2yv","updated":"20240522101945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“我就是在向您解釋怎樣解決您的Crohn’s呀。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-6sfirq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-6sfirq3","updated":"20240522101804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“您開的藥會殺死Crohn’s嗎？它們在不停地擴大。我僅剩的直腸上也有Crohn’s。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-k2ks1j3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-k2ks1j3","updated":"20240522101946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“南極有企鵝。佛羅里達有沒有？”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-qgfifzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-qgfifzc","updated":"20240522101810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“沒有。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-5iwlw8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-5iwlw8p","updated":"20240522101949"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“您的體內就像南極，Crohn’s就像企鵝。我把您的體內環境變成佛羅里達，那還會有企鵝嗎？”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-6yrg47t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-6yrg47t","updated":"20240522101812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“沒有。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-xhzp33w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-xhzp33w","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他又想起還有幾個問題。"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-po691tp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-po691tp","updated":"20240522101815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“哦，對了，我有吞咽困難。吃飯時，頭幾口都會噎著。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-kxrw248","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-kxrw248","updated":"20240522101955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“合情合理。您的體內太寒了，寒則縮。所以食道都縮緊了。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-o0kyu9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-o0kyu9o","updated":"20240522101817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“我的右腿坐骨神經痛。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-pu5oxv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-pu5oxv4","updated":"20240522101956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“那就請您躺上病床，我給您下針。您會明白什么叫做 ‘立竿見影’。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-9ygo4fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-9ygo4fd","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他狐疑地爬上病床……"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-g0o2c3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-g0o2c3d","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三根針下去，問他感覺如何。"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-svot4r4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-svot4r4","updated":"20240522101824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他興奮地說"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“不痛了。現在我相信你所說的了。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-ucoopcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-ucoopcb","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（我費了半天口舌，原來您老先生還以為我是在瞎掰吶。我要去面壁思過了，為什么自己長得那么像騙子呢？！）"}]},{"ID":"20240522101831-h00ixbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101831-h00ixbs"}},{"ID":"20240522101721-gg8ve6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-gg8ve6i","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷：裡寒濕重"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-aqzuriu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-aqzuriu","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-xuemjkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-xuemjkc","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子三錢，乾薑二錢，炙甘草五錢，白朮五錢，茯苓五錢，澤瀉五錢，細辛二錢，桂枝五錢，當歸三錢，無膽巴炮附二錢，白芍五錢，梔子三錢，半夏三錢，赤石脂二錢"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-091f6wd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-091f6wd","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2付"}]},{"ID":"20240522101835-b06ww99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101835-b06ww99"}},{"ID":"20240522101721-ykayc2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-ykayc2s","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方義見條辨如下："}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-qio72v2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-qio72v2","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【少陰病，下利便膿血者，桃花湯主之。】"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-ns1fe9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-ns1fe9x","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【手足厥寒，脈細欲絕者，當歸四逆湯主之。】"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-z8cojm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-z8cojm8","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【大汗出，熱不去，內拘急，四肢疼，又下利，厥逆而惡寒者，四逆湯主之。】"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-0bdvar6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-0bdvar6","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【傷寒服湯藥，下利不止，心下痞硬。服瀉心湯已，復以他藥下之，利不止，醫以理中與之，利益甚。理中者，理中焦，此利在下焦，赤石脂禹餘糧湯主之。復利不止者，當利其小便。】"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-5nxtxjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-5nxtxjt","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取針後，他又想起什么了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-i9bztun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-i9bztun","updated":"20240522101842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“對了，到了晚上我的肛門口會流出一些膠狀物。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-fvaheid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-fvaheid","updated":"20240522102002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“您的這種情況，1800年前就有一位中醫記錄在書上了，而且處方都開好了。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-3xum3tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-3xum3tw","updated":"20240522101844"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“真的嗎？！Wow！”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101855-8ghlxbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101855-8ghlxbi"}},{"ID":"20240522101721-0l0by2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-0l0by2w","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二診："}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-8hlatdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-8hlatdp","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12/2/09，星期三，"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-br3z5ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-br3z5ay","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"跟太太一起笑咪咪地進來。"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-843qh1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-843qh1l","updated":"20240522102006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“吃藥了嗎？”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-6p0jrof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-6p0jrof","updated":"20240522101902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“喝3杯了（也就是1付藥）。你們的藥有作用吶。我的手變溫了。吞咽也沒問題了。大便還是一天6次，但是其中有2次是較成形的了。我能感覺到直腸在扯動，應該是在治療。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-w43grkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-w43grkq","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"果然是經方的“一劑知”。"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-zbw6rkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-zbw6rkk","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他接著問——"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-foz01e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-foz01e6","updated":"20240522101905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“你上次跟我說的那位幾千年前的醫生，他叫什么名字？”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-uarhern","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-uarhern","updated":"20240522102009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“張仲景。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-9d4xfn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-9d4xfn9","updated":"20240522101908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“噢。他一定專治Crohn’s Disease。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-3a0uz9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-3a0uz9x","updated":"20240522102010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“不是。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-4kglg9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-4kglg9f","updated":"20240522101909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“不是？！”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-q9ncfpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-q9ncfpf","updated":"20240522102015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“他是治任何病的專家，是經方的鼻祖。中醫不分科，不立病名，辯證論治，從感冒到癌，全都要會。不像西醫，發明各種各樣的病名，都是疾病專家。”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-1rtzhy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-1rtzhy2","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他躺在病床上針灸時，跟他太太講要去吃中國餐，要去參加中國節（Chinese festival)，要去韓國店謝謝那位介紹他們來的老板……"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-qqq7cmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-qqq7cmj","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"顯然，這位意大利人開始對東方文明著迷了J"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-ratglji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-ratglji","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-r31hhr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-r31hhr3","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同11/30/09方"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-4pqdclc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-4pqdclc","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"改：赤石脂三錢"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-3dk1y9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-3dk1y9m","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加：粳米三錢"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-zdj2wzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-zdj2wzs","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4付"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-t3ascoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-t3ascoc","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下周三來復診"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-ryasx5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-ryasx5y","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（預知後事如何，請聽下回分解）"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-ipevxmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-ipevxmo","updated":"20240522101918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"草木醫師匯報2009年12月08日"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-dsjyzeu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-dsjyzeu","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-k523dhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-k523dhr","updated":"20240522101729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-yj22gse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-yj22gse","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  這位林醫師同時也是西醫學方面的藥物化學博士出身，現在是第一線的中醫師，北大化學系第一名畢業，讀者看她所寫的醫案，言簡剛中，毫不拖泥帶水，可以知道她的醫學素養與文學造詣都超人一等，是位重量級 又年輕的優秀經方家，她在老師身邊跟診超過三年時間，她天生就是一張娃娃臉，美麗又清秀，說話聲音更是嬌聲細語，而這位有眼不識泰山的義大利人，只因為看到這些，就以為她只是一名剛取得執照的醫師，卻不知道她是我超強的學生之一，光以生附子來說，我相信她絕對是比任何人都了解所謂烏頭鹼的神經性的毒性有多強，而讀者看她使用這生附子時，卻是多麼輕鬆自然，毒藥使用不當，當然會傷人，但是使用恰當，卻是可以救人性命，中藥的毒藥一般中醫不會使用，於是就推卸責任說是因為藥有毒，所以不用。讀者去問一下西藥師，哪一種西藥是沒有毒的？答案是，通通有毒。西藥有毒就可以使用，中藥有毒難道不行使用嗎？西藥的毒是化學毒，中藥的毒是天然的毒，二者不同，可憐的民眾卻寧可接受化學之毒，也不要中藥之毒，真是愚不可及啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-08r293d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-08r293d","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     林醫師在行醫的時候，不但將病人的病治療好轉，期間又在發揚國粹，宏揚我國故有文化於同時，真是得到老師的神髓。"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-vceazti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-vceazti","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522101721-u9ltdw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522101721-u9ltdw7","updated":"20240522101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海厦謹記於2009年12月11日"}]}]}